<title>USA: ABC Rail files for $100 mln shelf offer.</title>
<headline>ABC Rail files for $100 mln shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Rail Products Corp filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $100 million in subordinated debt securities and common shares.</p>
<p>The Chicago-based company said it will use proceeds for general corporate purposes, including reduction of debt and possible acquisitions.</p>
